# ADR-029 warm-standby: fill this in once, manually, before the first real
# failover. This file is deployed empty and never overwritten by Ansible
# (force: false) so a value filled in here survives re-runs of this role.
#
# Same value as the primary's `headscale-oidc` Kubernetes Secret
# (HEADSCALE_OIDC_CLIENT_SECRET key, sourced from Vault secret/headscale --
# this agent's own Vault AppRole is scoped to secret/garage and
# secret/homepage only, so it cannot fetch this value itself; a human with
# Vault access needs to copy it here).
HEADSCALE_OIDC_CLIENT_SECRET=
